# M4.29.2 local zsh expansion before remote install

Date: 2026-08-28

## Symptom

The planned remote reinstall command exited locally with `zsh: no matches
found` while parsing a JSON-validation regular expression.

## Cause

Nested quoting exposed `[[:space:]]` to the local interactive shell instead of
passing it literally to the remote shell.

## Impact

SSH was never invoked. The server unit, daemon state, services, Control and
Adult Candidate were not changed. The current Agentmode, Integrity and Monitor
services remain stopped.

## Resolution

Transmit the already reviewed transaction as a literal standard-input script
to remote `bash`. Parse observation JSON with `jq` and avoid nested regular
expressions. Retain the same fail-closed trap and recovery material.
